{"3750350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YOIN: The shadow of dawn", "steam_appid": 3750350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕯️ YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a voice. Without a body. Without time. Only one desire burns in your soul: <strong>to reclaim what was once your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world painted with ink and melancholy, you are a wandering spirit returning from the beyond to reclaim your village, now destroyed by invaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 What is YOIN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong> is a 2D top-down adventure and tactical action game set in a dreamlike feudal Japan. You are a ghost, invisible to humans, yet their life force hurts you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔮 Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 <strong>Play as a vengeful spirit:</strong> invisible to the naked eye, but perceptible through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕰️ Time is your enemy:</strong> you lose energy simply by existing in the world of the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ <strong>Reclaim your essence by defeating soldiers:</strong> only through killing do you recover life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Absorb energy from nature:</strong> trees, plants, and surrounding objects are your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Tactical stealth combat:</strong> your invisibility is your power, but also your vulnerability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Fragmented narrative:</strong> explore ruins, shrines, and cemeteries to discover who you were… and why you came back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Experience-based progression:</strong> unlock abilities, improve attributes, and unveil your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌒 <strong>Hand-drawn art design:</strong> each area has a unique aesthetic inspired by Japanese mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You are death returned.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore. Survive. Remember. Discover.</u></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🕯️ YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a voice. Without a body. Without time. Only one desire burns in your soul: <strong>to reclaim what was once your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world painted with ink and melancholy, you are a wandering spirit returning from the beyond to reclaim your village, now destroyed by invaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 What is YOIN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong> is a 2D top-down adventure and tactical action game set in a dreamlike feudal Japan. You are a ghost, invisible to humans, yet their life force hurts you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔮 Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 <strong>Play as a vengeful spirit:</strong> invisible to the naked eye, but perceptible through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕰️ Time is your enemy:</strong> you lose energy simply by existing in the world of the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ <strong>Reclaim your essence by defeating soldiers:</strong> only through killing do you recover life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Absorb energy from nature:</strong> trees, plants, and surrounding objects are your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Tactical stealth combat:</strong> your invisibility is your power, but also your vulnerability.</p></li><li>